# Composed prompts. Every byte is derivable from cases/ + prompt.md by
# `score.mjs --emit`, so committing 1.5 MB of them would only duplicate the
# corpus. The replies next to them are NOT derivable and are committed.
io/*.request.md
io-testimony/*.request.md
# The same, for every later arm (io-history, io-shipped, the controls).
io-*/*.request.md
